<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Dept of Transportation, Fla.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Dept of Transportation, Fla.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $200,000,000</p>
<p>DEPARTMENT OF TRANSPORTATION</p>
<p>RIGHT-OF-WAY ACQUISITION &amp; BRIDGE CONSTRUCTION</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A BONDS</p>
<p>(FULL FAITH AND CREDIT)</p>
<p>Effective at 3:00 P.M. E.D.T., Thursday, July 17, 1997 all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed from the following They will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
